                    <div class="project-highlight">Telehealth</div>
                    <h3>DocOnCall</h3>
                    <p>DocOnCall is a full-stack web application designed to simplify access to medical consultations by
                        connecting patients with doctors online.
                        The platform allows users to book appointments, submit basic health details, and consult doctors
                        remotely, reducing the need for physical hospital visits. It also features an AI-powered chatbot
                        for instant health queries and appointment reminders.

                        The system is built using the MERN stack, with a focus on clean UI, secure data handling, and
                        scalable backend architecture. It demonstrates real-world use cases like authentication, CRUD
                        operations, database relationships, and RESTful APIs.

                        This project simulates a real healthcare workflow and showcases my ability to build
                        production-like full-stack applications from scratch.</p>
